+## Sales and variance
+
+- `POST /import/sales` with `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }`
+  consumes one recipe portion per `qty` (ledger `ref` `sale:<ticket>`) and
+  answers `{ tickets, dishes }` (`dishes` is the portions sold). Tickets
+  imported before are skipped. One bad row or a shortage imports nothing and
+  the `bad_request` message names the row (`row 2` is the first data row).
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=&to=` lists per item `theoretical` (sales),
+  `actual` (all `consume` movements) and `difference` (actual - theoretical)
+  for those days, inclusive.
